{"id":"aceite","lemma":"aceite","pos":"noun","rank":1974,"glosses":["oil","olive oil"],"ipa":"/aˈθeite/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aceites"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-aceite.wav","formAudio":{"aceites":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-aceites.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Eso fue cocinado en aceite.","en":"That was cooked in oil.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78219","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to cook","l":"cocinar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"No puedes mezclar agua y aceite.","en":"You can't mix oil and water.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to mix"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Él compró mucha harina y aceite.","en":"He bought a lot of flour and oil.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353958","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"flour"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"¿Has comprobado el nivel de aceite últimamente?","en":"Have you checked the oil level recently?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831459","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"verified"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"level, tier, height"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"recently, lately"}]},{"text":"El papel absorbe el aceite.","en":"Paper absorbs oil.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"paper"},{"g":"to absorb","l":"absorber"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}